{"ticker":"HIMS","updated":"2026-10-23T23:04:28Z","profile":{"longName":"Hims & Hers Health, Inc.","shortName":"Hims & Hers Health, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"United States","website":"https://www.hims.com","fullTimeEmployees":2442,"marketCap":6465114112,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":37.585114,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.5076933,"pegRatio":2.66,"targetMeanPrice":31.15385,"targetHighPrice":42.0,"targetLowPrice":23.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.382,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.69528997,"operatingMargins":-0.12751001,"profitMargins":-0.05509,"totalRevenue":2578112000,"beta":2.432,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":50.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":13.74,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Hims & Hers Health, Inc. operates as a consumer-first health and wellness platform that connects consumers to licensed healthcare professionals in the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada, Germany, the Republic of Ireland, France, Spain, Australia, and internationally. The company offers a range of curated prescription and non-prescription health and wellness products and services available to purchase on its websites and mobile application directly by customers. It also provides personalized health and wellness products; over-the-counter drug and device products, cosmetics, and supplement products primarily focusing on general wellness, skincare, sexual health and wellness, and hair care under the Hims & Hers brand name; and laboratory testing services to measure a set of biomarkers. Additionally, it offers medical consultation, post-consultation support services, and delivery of laboratory testing results services. Further, the company provides treatments and products for various chronic conditions related to hormone health, weight loss, dermatology, and mental health. The company offers its products through retail partnerships, in stores, and online. The company was formerly known as Hims, Inc. and changed its name to Hims & Hers Health, Inc. in January 2021. The company was founded in 2017 and is based in San Francisco, California.","summary_zh":"Hims & Hers Health, Inc. 是一個消費者至上的健康和保健平台，將消費者與美國、英國、加拿大、德國、愛爾蘭共和國、法國、西班牙、澳洲和國際上的持證醫療保健專業人士聯繫起來。該公司提供一系列精選的處方和非處方保健產品和服務，客戶可以直接在其網站和行動應用程式上購買。它還提供個人化的健康和保健產品； Hims & Hers 品牌下的非處方藥品和器械產品、化妝品和補充劑產品，主要專注於一般健康、皮膚護理、性健康和保健以及護髮；以及測量一組生物標誌物的實驗室測試服務。此外，它還提供醫療諮詢、諮詢後支援服務以及提供實驗室檢測結果服務。此外，該公司還提供與荷爾蒙健康、減肥、皮膚科和心理健康相關的各種慢性病的治療和產品。該公司透過零售合作夥伴、商店和網路銷售其產品。該公司原名 Hims, Inc.，於 2021 年 1 月更名為 Hims & Hers Health, Inc.。該公司成立於 2017 年，總部位於加州舊金山。","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 特用藥品和非專利藥品","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":44.44,"h":44.83,"l":42.97,"c":42.99,"v":17811100},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":43.5,"h":46.291,"l":43.1,"c":45.35,"v":29415900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":45.32,"h":45.924,"l":43.99,"c":44.01,"v":19903400},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":44.45,"h":45.1,"l":43.8,"c":44.12,"v":17802000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":44.2,"h":44.49,"l":42.21,"c":42.35,"v":16151100},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":41.34,"h":42.14,"l":40.78,"c":41.53,"v":14391200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":43.0,"h":45.67,"l":42.5,"c":44.46,"v":30523600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":44.54,"h":48.29,"l":44.3,"c":48.11,"v":44797900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":48.83,"h":49.16,"l":46.857,"c":48.41,"v":24064500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":49.12,"h":51.585,"l":49.09,"c":49.64,"v":34988000},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":49.97,"h":50.459,"l":47.48,"c":47.79,"v":22266900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":50.0,"h":51.415,"l":47.52,"c":47.78,"v":29097500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":48.82,"h":52.49,"l":48.6,"c":51.76,"v":34586700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":51.03,"h":55.93,"l":50.25,"c":55.5,"v":35502300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":54.99,"h":56.52,"l":53.91,"c":53.96,"v":28041700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":54.32,"h":54.336,"l":48.69,"c":50.89,"v":49261600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":50.29,"h":51.0,"l":49.17,"c":50.35,"v":26977800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":50.4,"h":56.31,"l":50.27,"c":56.2,"v":3720600